WEBVTT

00:00:02.160 --> 00:00:07.618
<v Caller>When was the last time an independent team tested how you’d respond to a security incident?

00:00:07.830 --> 00:00:10.884
<v IT leader>Our managed IT provider handles security.

00:00:11.157 --> 00:00:13.163
<v Caller>What did their last review cover?

00:00:13.316 --> 00:00:17.614
<v IT leader>They checked our tools. We haven’t tested our incident response plan.

00:00:17.840 --> 00:00:20.233
<v Caller>Who would lead that exercise on your side?

00:00:20.438 --> 00:00:23.516
<v IT leader>I’d lead it. Operations would need to be there.

00:00:23.804 --> 00:00:28.096
<v Caller>Would 15 minutes Tuesday work to see what an independent review would cover?

00:00:28.309 --> 00:00:31.629
<v IT leader>Ten Eastern works. I’ll bring our operations lead.
